{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2022-02-16 07:00:00', 'title': 'JACOBS AND MACE TO MANAGE REGENERATION OF THE ELLINIKON, GREECE', 'text': 'DALLAS, FEB. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MACE AND JACOBS, ACTING AS A JOINT VENTURE, HAVE BEEN APPOINTED AS OVERALL PROGRAM MANAGEMENT CONSULTANT AND PROJECT MANAGEMENT CONSULTANT FOR BUILDINGS BY HELLINIKON S.A., A SUBSIDIARY OF LAMDA DEVELOPMENT S.A.'}